				12.39.36
			</span></i> : c. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθηναίους</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				16
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				45.20
			</span></i> (Halic., <span class="entity">v B. C.</span>).</div>
